{"title":"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2ea1836252448a41bf2edd94f926bcaa65e82cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9 + 3 \\times 3}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a> and evaluating, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b803868ce7825f4a9cce2a1203702c04de1164.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9 + 3 \\times 3}{3} = \\frac{9 + 9}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"146\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/3/c03885eaae72f8450f87b4c88bba30d55737dc0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{18}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/6272e08e606483ea2c2a23d2905640f4885d6d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/5670d0b0089a553b228f53545041e02a8c2c9498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9 + 3 \\times 3}{3} = \\frac{3 \\times 3 + 3 \\times 3}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17b27cb3665249d46f710d667e19e400eee4290e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=3 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/6272e08e606483ea2c2a23d2905640f4885d6d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC\">2018 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 10 (page does not exist)\